  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Norway&apos;s Contribution to Joint Peace Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Peace Support Gruop (PSG) is working to create a joint peace fund to fund for peace building activities in Myanmar. The Government of Myanmar and at least 16 armed ethnic groups are currently negotiating for a Nationwide Ceasefire Accord,  and in response to the peace effort the internatinoal community has promised to provide financial, technial and advisory support towards the peace process.  Norway as the first foreign country to engage in Myanmar peace process.</narrative>
  </description>
